on, power and personnel access constrain one another.","Rock type, integrity and groundwater affect excavation-method suitability."],"answer":0,"explanation":"移除材料改變周圍應力，開挖面需配合地盤反應評估。","explanationEn":"Removing material redistributes stress; face stability depends on ground response."},"prerequisiteIds":["hsuehshan-s03-01"],"sequence":8,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"hsuehshan-s03-03","order":3,"title":"配置施工物流","titleEn":"Plan construction logistics","objective":"完成「配置施工物流」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for plan construction logistics.","knowledge":[{"id":"hsuehshan-s03-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"運碴、通風、供電與人員路徑會互相限制。","textEn":"Muck removal, ventilation, power and personnel access constrain one another."},{"id":"hsuehshan-s03-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"在平面圖分開人員與物料路徑。","textEn":"Separate personnel and material routes on a plan."}],"check":"在平面圖分開人員與物料路徑。","checkEn":"Separate personnel and material routes on a plan.","sourceIds":["freeway-hsuehshan"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「配置施工物流」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains plan construction logistics?","options":["岩性、完整度及地下水條件影響開挖方式適用性。","移除材料改變周圍應力，開挖面需配合地盤反應評估。","運碴、通風、供電與人員路徑會互相限制。"],"optionsEn":["Rock type, integrity and groundwater affect excavation-method suitability.","Removing material redistributes stress; face stability depends on ground response.","Muck removal, ventilation, power and personnel access constrain one another."],"answer":2,"explanation":"運碴、通風、供電與人員路徑會互相限制。","explanationEn":"Muck removal, ventilation, power and personnel access constrain one another."},"prerequisiteIds":["hsuehshan-s03-02"],"sequence":9,"estimatedMinutes":15}]},{"id":"hsuehshan-s04","order":4,"title":"支護與襯砌","titleEn":"Support and lining","steps":[{"id":"hsuehshan-s04-01","order":1,"title":"理解初期支護","titleEn":"Understand initial support","objective":"完成「理解初期支護」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiv