vehicle.","sourceIds":["ferrari-body"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「規劃可追溯編號」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains plan traceable identifiers?","options":["車身、底盤及動力系統的介面決定整車整合。","零件批號與裝配紀錄可定位受影響車輛。","性能、舒適、排放與成本形成互相牽制的需求。"],"optionsEn":["Body, chassis and powertrain interfaces determine vehicle integration.","Part lots and assembly records identify affected vehicles.","Performance, comfort, emissions and cost create interacting requirements."],"answer":1,"explanation":"零件批號與裝配紀錄可定位受影響車輛。","explanationEn":"Part lots and assembly records identify affected vehicles."},"prerequisiteIds":["ferrari-s01-02"],"sequence":3,"estimatedMinutes":15}]},{"id":"ferrari-s02","order":2,"title":"車身結構","titleEn":"Body structure","steps":[{"id":"ferrari-s02-01","order":1,"title":"理解承載式車身","titleEn":"Understand load-bearing bodywork","objective":"完成「理解承載式車身」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand load-bearing bodywork.","knowledge":[{"id":"ferrari-s02-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"車身形狀、材料及接頭共同影響剛度與載荷傳遞。","textEn":"Body shape, materials and joints jointly affect stiffness and load transfer."},{"id":"ferrari-s02-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"畫出前後載荷的概念傳遞路徑。","textEn":"Draw conceptual front-to-rear load paths."}],"check":"畫出前後載荷的概念傳遞路徑。","checkEn":"Draw conceptual front-to-rear load paths.","sourceIds":["ferrari-body"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解承載式車身」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand load-bearing bodywork?","options":["成形改變材料形狀，加工移除材料，公差控制方式不同。","焊接、鉚接與黏著適用於不同材料與接頭需求。","車身形狀、材料及接頭共同影響剛度與載荷傳遞。"],"optionsEn":["Forming reshapes material; machining removes it, with different tolerance controls.","Welding, riveting and bonding suit different materials and joints.","Body shape, materials and joints jointly affect stiffness and load transfer."],"answer":2,"explanation":"車身形狀、材料及接頭共同影響剛度與載荷傳遞。","explanationEn":"Body shape, materials and joints jointly affect stiffness and load transfer."},"prerequisiteIds":["ferrari-s01-03"],"sequence":4,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"ferrari-s02-02","order":2,"title":"比較成形與加工","titleEn":"Compare forming and machining","objective":"完成「比較成形與加工」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for compare forming and machining.","knowledge":[{"id":"ferrari-s02-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"成形改變材料形狀，加工移除材料，公差控制方式不同。","textEn":"Forming reshapes material; machining removes it, with different tolerance controls."},{"id":"ferrari-s02-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"比較一片外板與一個精密軸件的製程需求。","textEn":"Compare process needs of a body panel and precision shaft."}],"check":"比較一片外板與一個精密軸件的製程需求。","checkEn":"Compare process needs of a body panel and precision shaft.","sourceIds":["ferrari-body"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「比較成形與加工」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains compare forming and machining?","options":["車身形狀、材料及接頭共同影響剛度與載荷傳遞。","成形改變材料形狀，加工移除材料，公差控制方式不同。","焊接、鉚接與黏著適用於不同材料與接頭需求。"],"optionsEn":["Body shape, materials and joints jointly affect stiffness and load transfer.","Forming reshapes material; machining removes it, with different tolerance controls.","Welding, riveting and bonding suit different materials and joints."],"answer":1,"explanation":"成形改變材料形狀，加工移除材料，公差控制方式不同。","explanationEn":"Forming reshapes material; machining removes it, with different tolerance controls."},"prerequisiteIds":["ferrari-s02-01"],"sequence":5,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"ferrari-s02-03","order":3,"title":"檢查車身接合","titleEn":"Review body joining","objective":"完成「檢查車身接合」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for review body joining.","knowledge":[{"id":"ferrari-s02-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"焊接、鉚接與黏著適用於不同材料與接頭需求。","textEn":"Welding, riveting and bonding suit different materials and joints."},{"id":"ferrari-s02-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"建立材料、接合方式與檢查方法的對照表。","textEn":"Map materials, joining methods and inspections."}],"check":"建立材料、接合方式與檢查方法的對照表。","checkEn":"Map materials, joining methods and inspections.","sourceIds":["ferrari-body"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「檢查車身接合」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains review body joining?","options":["焊接、鉚接與黏著適用於不同材料與接頭需求。","車身形狀、材料及接頭共同影響剛度與載荷傳遞。","成形改變材料形狀，加工移除材料，公差控制方式不同。"],"optionsEn":["Welding, riveting and bonding suit different materials and joints.","Body shape, materials and joints jointly affect stiffness and load transfer.","Forming reshapes material; machining removes it, with different tolerance controls."],"answer":0,"explanation":"焊接、鉚接與黏著適用於不同材料與接頭需求。","explanationEn":"Welding, riveting and bonding suit different materials and joints."},"prerequisiteIds":["ferrari-s02-02"],"sequence":6,"estimatedMinutes":15}]},{"id":"ferrari-s03","order":3,"title":"動力與冷卻概念","titleEn":"Powertrain and cooling concepts","steps":[{"id":"ferrari-s03-01","order":1,"title":"畫出能量傳遞","titleEn":"Map energy transfer","objective":"完成「畫出能量傳遞」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for map energy transfer.","knowledge":[{"id":"ferrari-s03-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"動力來源經傳動系統把能量送到輪端，途中有熱與摩擦損失。","textEn":"Power passes through the drivetrain to wheels with heat and friction losses."},{"id":"ferrari-s03-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"在能源圖標出輸入、輪端功與損失。","textEn":"Mark input, wheel work and losses."}],"check":"在能源圖標出輸入、輪端功與損失。","checkEn":"Mark input, wheel work and losses.","sourceIds":["ferrari-body"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「畫出能量傳遞」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains map energy transfer?","options":["多個零件公差累積會影響對位、間隙和運轉。","動力來源經傳動系統把能量送到輪端，途中有熱與摩擦損失。","冷卻需平衡散熱量、流動阻力及環境條件。"],"optionsEn":["Accumulated part tolerances affect alignment, clearance and operation.","Power passes through the drivetrain to wheels with heat and friction losses.","Cooling balances heat rejection, flow resistance and environment."],"answer":1,"explanation":"動力來源經傳動系統把能量送到輪端，途中有熱與摩擦損失。","explanationEn":"Power passes through the drivetrain to wheels with heat and friction losses."},"prerequisiteIds":["ferrari-s02-03"],"sequence":7,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"ferrari-s03-02","order":2,"title":"理解熱管理","titleEn":"Understand thermal management","objective":"完成「理解熱管理」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand thermal management.","knowledge":[{"id":"ferrari-s03-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"冷卻需平衡散熱量、流動阻力及環境條件。","textEn":"Cooling balances heat rejection, flow resistance and environment."},{"id":"ferrari-s03-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"比較怠速與行駛的概念散熱條件。","textEn":"Compare conceptual cooling at idle and in motion."}],"check":"比較怠速與行駛的概念散熱條件。","checkEn":"Compare conceptual cooling at idle and in motion.","sourceIds":["ferrari-body"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解熱管理」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand thermal management?","options":["冷卻需平衡散熱量、流動阻力及環境條件。","多個零件公差累積會影響對位、間隙和運轉。","動力來源經傳動系統把能量送到輪端，途中有熱與摩擦損失。"],"optionsEn":["Cooling balances heat rejection, flow resistance and environment.","Accumulated part tolerances affect alignment, clearance and operation.","Power passes through the drivetrain to wheels with heat and friction losses."],"answer":0,"explanation":"冷卻需平衡散熱量、流動阻力及環境條件。","explanationEn":"Cooling balances heat rejection, flow resistance and environment."},"prerequisiteIds":["ferrari-s03-01"],"sequence":8,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"ferrari-s03-03","order":3,"title":"檢查裝配公差鏈","titleEn":"Review tolerance stacks","objective":"完成「檢查裝配公差鏈」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for review tolerance stacks.","knowledge":[{"id":"ferrari-s03-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"多個零件公差累積會影響對位、間隙和運轉。","textEn":"Accumulated part tolerances affect alignment, clearance and operation."},{"id":"ferrari-s03-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"為三件虛擬零件建立公差鏈。","textEn":"Build a tolerance chain for three virtual parts."}],"check":"為三件虛擬零件建立公差鏈。","checkEn":"Build a tolerance chain for three virtual parts.","sourceIds":["ferrari-body"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「檢查裝配公差鏈」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains review tolerance stacks?","options":["動力來源經傳動系統把能量送到輪端，途中有熱與摩擦損失。","冷卻需平衡散熱量、流動阻力及環境條件。","多個零件公差累積會影響對位、間隙和運轉。"],"optionsEn":["Power passes through the drivetrain to wheels with heat and friction losses.","Cooling balances heat rejection, flow resistance and environment.","Accumulated part tolerances affect alignment, clearance and operation."],"answer":2,"explanation":"多個零件公差累積會影響對位、間隙和運轉。","explanationEn":"Accumulated part tolerances affect alignment, clearance and operation."},"prerequisiteIds":["ferrari-s03-02"],"sequence":9,"estimatedMinutes":15}]},{"id":"ferrari-s04","order":4,"title":"底盤與人機","titleEn":"Chassis and human factors","steps":[{"id":"ferrari-s04-01","order":1,"title":"理解懸吊功能","titleEn":"Understand suspension functions","objective":"完成「理解懸吊功能」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand suspension functions.","knowledge":[{"id":"ferrari-s04-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"懸吊在輪胎接地、車身運動與舒適間取捨。","textEn":"Suspension trades tire contact, body motion and comfort."},{"id":"ferrari-s04-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"用質量彈簧阻尼圖指出每個元件角色。","textEn":"Identify elements in a mass-spring-damper diagram."}],"check":"用質量彈簧阻尼圖指出每個元件角色。","checkEn":"Identify elements in a mass-spring-damper diagram.","sourceIds":["ferrari-body"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解懸吊功能」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand suspension functions?","options":["懸吊在輪胎接地、車身運動與舒適間取捨。","制動系統需處理能量及輪胎抓地限制。","駕駛資訊應提供一致單位、優先級及異常狀態。"],"optionsEn":["Suspension trades tire contact, body motion and comfort.","Braking deals with energy and tire-grip limits.","Driver information needs consistent units, priorities and abnormal states."],"answer":0,"explanation":"懸吊在輪胎接地、車身運動與舒適間取捨。","explanationEn":"Suspension trades tire contact, body motion and comfort."},"prerequisiteIds":["ferrari-s03-03"],"sequence":10,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"ferrari-s04-02","order":2,"title":"理解制動功能分配","titleEn":"Understand brake allocation","objective":"完成「理解制動功能分配」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand brake allocation.","knowledge":[{"id":"ferrari-s04-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"制動系統需處理能量及輪胎抓地限制。","textEn":"Braking deals with energy and tire-grip limits."},{"id":"ferrari-s04-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"用示意能量圖說明連續制動的熱負載。","textEn":"Explain repeated-braking heat load using an energy diagram."}],"check":"用示意能量圖說明連續制動的熱負載。","checkEn":"Explain repeated-braking heat load using an energy diagram.","sourceIds":["ferrari-body"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解制動功能分配」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand brake allocation?","options":["駕駛資訊應提供一致單位、優先級及異常狀態。","懸吊在輪胎接地、車身運動與舒適間取捨。","制動系統需處理能量及輪胎抓地限制。"],"optionsEn":["Driver information needs consistent units, priorities and abnormal states.","Suspension trades tire contact, body motion and comfort.","Braking deals with energy and tire-grip limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"制動系統需處理能量及輪胎抓地限制。","explanationEn":"Braking deals with energy and tire-grip limits."},"prerequisiteIds":["ferrari-s04-01"],"sequence":11,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"ferrari-s04-03","order":3,"title":"設計清楚儀表","titleEn":"Design clear instruments","objective":"完成「設計清楚儀表」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for design clear instruments.","knowledge":[{"id":"ferrari-s04-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"駕駛資訊應提供一致單位、優先級及異常狀態。","textEn":"Driver information needs consistent units, priorities and abnormal states."},{"id":"ferrari-s04-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"檢查虛擬儀表是否混淆正常與警示。","textEn":"Check the virtual display distinguishes normal and warning states."}],"check":"檢查虛擬儀表是否混淆正常與警示。","checkEn":"Check the virtual display distinguishes normal and warning states.","sourceIds":["ferrari-body"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「設計清楚儀表」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains design clear instruments?","options":["制動系統需處理能量及輪胎抓地限制。","駕駛資訊應提供一致單位、優先級及異常狀態。","懸吊在輪胎接地、車身運動與舒適間取捨。"],"optionsEn":["Braking deals with energy and tire-grip limits.","Driver information needs consistent units, priorities and abnormal states.","Suspension trades tire contact, body motion and comfort."],"answer":1,"explanation":"駕駛資訊應提供一致單位、優先級及異常狀態。","explanationEn":"Driver information needs consistent units, priorities and abnormal states."},"prerequisiteIds":["ferrari-s04-02"],"sequence":12,"estimatedMinutes":15}]},{"id":"ferrari-s05","order":5,"title":"塗裝與外觀品質","titleEn":"Finishing and appearance quality","steps":[{"id":"ferrari-s05-01","order":1,"title":"理解表面前處理","titleEn":"Understand surface preparation","objective":"完成「理解表面前處理」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand surface preparation.","knowledge":[{"id":"ferrari-s05-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"附著與防腐效果取決於基材表面狀態。","textEn":"Adhesion and corrosion protection depend on substrate condition."},{"id":"ferrari-s05-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"列出表面潔淨、均勻性與追溯檢查。","textEn":"List cleanliness, uniformity and traceability checks."}],"check":"列出表面潔淨、均勻性與追溯檢查。","checkEn":"List cleanliness, uniformity and traceability checks.","sourceIds":["ferrari-body"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解表面前處理」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand surface preparation?","options":["外觀間隙和面差是可量測的幾何品質，需有一致基準。","返工需保留原因、版本與再次檢驗結果。","附著與防腐效果取決於基材表面狀態。"],"optionsEn":["Gap and flushness are measurable geometric qualities needing consistent references.","Rework retains cause, revision and reinspection results.","Adhesion and corrosion protection depend on substrate condition."],"answer":2,"explanation":"附著與防腐效果取決於基材表面狀態。","explanationEn":"Adhesion and corrosion protection depend on substrate condition."},"prerequisiteIds":["ferrari-s04-03"],"sequence":13,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"ferrari-s05-02","order":2,"title":"檢查間隙與面差","titleEn":"Inspect gaps and flushness","objective":"完成「檢查間隙與面差」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for inspect gaps and flushness.","knowledge":[{"id":"ferrari-s05-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"外觀間隙和面差是可量測的幾何品質，需有一致基準。","textEn":"Gap and flushness are measurable geometric qualities needing consistent references."},{"id":"ferrari-s05-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"在虛擬車門標出量測方向。","textEn":"Mark measurement directions on a virtual door."}],"check":"在虛擬車門標出量測方向。","checkEn":"Mark measurement directions on a virtual door.","sourceIds":["ferrari-body"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「檢查間隙與面差」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains inspect gaps and flushness?","options":["附著與防腐效果取決於基材表面狀態。","外觀間隙和面差是可量測的幾何品質，需有一致基準。","返工需保留原因、版本與再次檢驗結果。"],"optionsEn":["Adhesion and corrosion protection depend on substrate condition.","Gap and flushness are measurable geometric qualities needing consistent references.","Rework retains cause, revision and reinspection results."],"answer":1,"explanation":"外觀間隙和面差是可量測的幾何品質，需有一致基準。","explanationEn":"Gap and flushness are measurable geometric qualities needing consisten