nked harness, sensor and display checks."}],"check":"為線束、感測與儀表設計連動檢查。","checkEn":"Define linked harness, sensor and display checks.","sourceIds":["ferrari-body"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「建立功能檢查」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains build functional checks?","options":["交付需連結版本、檢查結果與未結事項。","分系統合格仍需整車介面測試。","台架可隔離變數，整車情境可揭露耦合效應。"],"optionsEn":["Handover connects revisions, inspection results and open issues.","Subsystem acceptance still needs vehicle-level interface tests.","Bench tests isolate variables; vehicle scenarios expose coupling."],"answer":1,"explanation":"分系統合格仍需整車介面測試。","explanationEn":"Subsystem acceptance still needs vehicle-level interface tests."},"prerequisiteIds":["ferrari-s05-03"],"sequence":16,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"ferrari-s06-02","order":2,"title":"分辨路試與台架證據","titleEn":"Distinguish road and bench evidence","objective":"完成「分辨路試與台架證據」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for distinguish road and bench evidence.","knowledge":[{"id":"ferrari-s06-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"台架可隔離變數，整車情境可揭露耦合效應。","textEn":"Bench tests isolate variables; vehicle scenarios expose coupling."},{"id":"ferrari-s06-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"比較兩類證據能回答的問題。","textEn":"Compare questions answered by each evidence type."}],"check":"比較兩類證據能回答的問題。","checkEn":"Compare questions answered by each evidence type.","sourceIds":["ferrari-body"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「分辨路試與台架證據」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains distinguish road and bench evidence?","options":["台架可隔離變數，整車情境可揭露耦合效應。","交付需連結版本、檢查結果與未結事項。","分系統合格仍需整車介面測試。"],"optionsEn":["Bench tests isolate variables; vehicle scenarios expose coupling.","Handover connects revisions, inspection results and open issues.","Subsystem acceptance still needs vehicle-level interface tests."],"answer":0,"explanation":"台架可隔離變數，整車情境可揭露耦合效應。","explanationEn":"Bench tests isolate variables; vehicle scenarios expose coupling."},"prerequisiteIds":["ferrari-s06-01"],"sequence":17,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"ferrari-s06-03","order":3,"title":"完成品質交付","titleEn":"Complete quality handover","objective":"完成「完成品質交付」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for complete quality handover.","knowledge":[{"id":"ferrari-s06-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"交付需連結版本、檢查結果與未結事項。","textEn":"Handover connects revisions, inspection results and open issues."},{"id":"ferrari-s06-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"匯出虛擬車輛履歷與未完成清單。","textEn":"Export virtual vehicle history and open tasks."}],"check":"匯出虛擬車輛履歷與未完成清單。","checkEn":"Export virtual vehicle history and open tasks.","sourceIds":["ferrari-body"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「完成品質交付」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains complete quality handover?","options":["分系統合格仍需整車介面測試。","台架可隔離變數，整車情境可揭露耦合效應。","交付需連結版本、檢查結果與未結事項。"],"optionsEn":["Subsystem acceptance still needs vehicle-level interface tests.","Bench tests isolate variables; vehicle scenarios expose coupling.","Handover connects revisions, inspection results and open issues."],"answer":2,"explanation":"交付需連結版本、檢查結果與未結事項。","explanationEn":"Handover connects revisions, inspection results and open issues."},"prerequisiteIds":["ferrari-s06-02"],"sequence":18,"estimatedMinutes":15}]}],"stepCount":18,"estimatedMinutes":270,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"status":"guided","kind":"course"},{"id":"tesla","title":"特斯拉與電動汽車工程","titleEn":"Tesla and Electric Vehicle Engineering","category":"automotive","summary":"以電池、驅動、熱管理、車身與軟體的整體整合為主線，建立安全的虛擬製造學習流程。","summaryEn":"Study battery, drive, thermal, body and software integration in a safe virtual manufacturing workflow.","scope":"公開原理的分層工程教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務，並非原廠配方、施工圖或操作許可。","scopeEn":"A layered course in public engineering principles. Steps are verifiable learning tasks, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, or operating authorization.","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"diagram":{"type":"ev","labels":["電池","逆變器","馬達","冷卻","控制"],"labelsEn":["Battery","Inverter","Motor","Cooling","Control"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"depth":4,"stages":[{"id":"tesla-s01","order":1,"title":"需求與能源","titleEn":"Requirements and energy","steps":[{"id":"tesla-s01-01","order":1,"title":"建立行駛能耗模型","titleEn":"Build a driving-energy model","objective":"完成「建立行駛能耗模型」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for build a driving-energy model.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s01-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"風阻、滾阻、坡度與加速共同決定車輛能耗。","textEn":"Drag, rolling resistance, grade and acceleration jointly determine energy use."},{"id":"tesla-s01-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"比較平路恆速與上坡情境。","textEn":"Compare steady level travel and climbing."}],"check":"比較平路恆速與上坡情境。","checkEn":"Compare steady level travel and climbing.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「建立行駛能耗模型」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains build a driving-energy model?","options":["風阻、滾阻、坡度與加速共同決定車輛能耗。","kW 表示功率，kWh 表示能量，不能互換。","高壓、低壓及資料通訊需要清楚邊界。"],"optionsEn":["Drag, rolling resistance, grade and acceleration jointly determine energy use.","kW measures power and kWh measures energy; they are not interchangeable.","High voltage, low voltage and data communication need clear boundaries."],"answer":0,"explanation":"風阻、滾阻、坡度與加速共同決定車輛能耗。","explanationEn":"Drag, rolling resistance, grade and acceleration jointly determine energy use."},"prerequisiteIds":[],"sequence":1,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"tesla-s01-02","order":2,"title":"分辨功率與容量","titleEn":"Distinguish power and capacity","objective":"完成「分辨功率與容量」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for distinguish power and capacity.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s01-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"kW 表示功率，kWh 表示能量，不能互換。","textEn":"kW measures power and kWh measures energy; they are not interchangeable."},{"id":"tesla-s01-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"核對示意規格表所有單位。","textEn":"Check every unit in the illustrative specification."}],"check":"核對示意規格表所有單位。","checkEn":"Check every unit in the illustrative specification.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「分辨功率與容量」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains distinguish power and capacity?","options":["高壓、低壓及資料通訊需要清楚邊界。","風阻、滾阻、坡度與加速共同決定車輛能耗。","kW 表示功率，kWh 表示能量，不能互換。"],"optionsEn":["High voltage, low voltage and data communication need clear boundaries.","Drag, rolling resistance, grade and acceleration jointly determine energy use.","kW measures power and kWh measures energy; they are not interchangeable."],"answer":2,"explanation":"kW 表示功率，kWh 表示能量，不能互換。","explanationEn":"kW measures power and kWh measures energy; they are not interchangeable."},"prerequisiteIds":["tesla-s01-01"],"sequence":2,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"tesla-s01-03","order":3,"title":"建立系統界面","titleEn":"Map system interfaces","objective":"完成「建立系統界面」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for map system interfaces.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s01-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"高壓、低壓及資料通訊需要清楚邊界。","textEn":"High voltage, low voltage and data communication need clear boundaries."},{"id":"tesla-s01-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"以不同線型區分三類虛擬介面。","textEn":"Use distinct line styles for the three virtual interfaces."}],"check":"以不同線型區分三類虛擬介面。","checkEn":"Use distinct line styles for the three virtual interfaces.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「建立系統界面」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains map system interfaces?","options":["kW 表示功率，kWh 表示能量，不能互換。","高壓、低壓及資料通訊需要清楚邊界。","風阻、滾阻、坡度與加速共同決定車輛能耗。"],"optionsEn":["kW measures power and kWh measures energy; they are not interchangeable.","High voltage, low voltage and data communication need clear boundaries.","Drag, rolling resistance, grade and acceleration jointly determine energy use."],"answer":1,"explanation":"高壓、低壓及資料通訊需要清楚邊界。","explanationEn":"High voltage, low voltage and data communication need clear boundaries."},"prerequisiteIds":["tesla-s01-02"],"sequence":3,"estimatedMinutes":15}]},{"id":"tesla-s02","order":2,"title":"電池系統概念","titleEn":"Battery-system concepts","steps":[{"id":"tesla-s02-01","order":1,"title":"理解電芯差異","titleEn":"Understand cell differences","objective":"完成「理解電芯差異」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand cell differences.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s02-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"不同化學系統在能量、功率、壽命和成本方面取捨不同。","textEn":"Cell chemistries trade energy, power, lifetime and cost differently."},{"id":"tesla-s02-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"建立定性比較，不宣稱單一化學全面最佳。","textEn":"Create a qualitative comparison without claiming one universal winner."}],"check":"建立定性比較，不宣稱單一化學全面最佳。","checkEn":"Create a qualitative comparison without claiming one universal winner.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解電芯差異」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand cell differences?","options":["BMS 監測狀態並管理限制，估測荷電狀態帶有誤差。","電氣隔離與故障偵測降低異常傳播，但需系統驗證。","不同化學系統在能量、功率、壽命和成本方面取捨不同。"],"optionsEn":["BMS monitors state and manages limits; state-of-charge estimates contain error.","Electrical isolation and fault detection limit abnormal propagation but need system validation.","Cell chemistries trade energy, power, lifetime and cost differently."],"answer":2,"explanation":"不同化學系統在能量、功率、壽命和成本方面取捨不同。","explanationEn":"Cell chemistries trade energy, power, lifetime and cost differently."},"prerequisiteIds":["tesla-s01-03"],"sequence":4,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"tesla-s02-02","order":2,"title":"理解 BMS 功能","titleEn":"Understand BMS functions","objective":"完成「理解 BMS 功能」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand bms functions.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s02-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"BMS 監測狀態並管理限制，估測荷電狀態帶有誤差。","textEn":"BMS monitors state and manages limits; state-of-charge estimates contain error."},{"id":"tesla-s02-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"區分量測電壓與估測荷電狀態。","textEn":"Distinguish measured voltage from estimated state of charge."}],"check":"區分量測電壓與估測荷電狀態。","checkEn":"Distinguish measured voltage from estimated state of charge.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解 BMS 功能」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand bms functions?","options":["不同化學系統在能量、功率、壽命和成本方面取捨不同。","BMS 監測狀態並管理限制，估測荷電狀態帶有誤差。","電氣隔離與故障偵測降低異常傳播，但需系統驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Cell chemistries trade energy, power, lifetime and cost differently.","BMS monitors state and manages limits; state-of-charge estimates contain error.","Electrical isolation and fault detection limit abnormal propagation but need system validation."],"answer":1,"explanation":"BMS 監測狀態並管理限制，估測荷電狀態帶有誤差。","explanationEn":"BMS monitors state and manages limits; state-of-charge estimates contain error."},"prerequisiteIds":["tesla-s02-01"],"sequence":5,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"tesla-s02-03","order":3,"title":"辨識隔離與故障偵測","titleEn":"Identify isolation and fault detection","objective":"完成「辨識隔離與故障偵測」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for identify isolation and fault detection.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s02-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"電氣隔離與故障偵測降低異常傳播，但需系統驗證。","textEn":"Electrical isolation and fault detection limit abnormal propagation but need system validation."},{"id":"tesla-s02-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"只在低能量虛擬模型中設計狀態圖。","textEn":"Design state diagrams only in a low-energy virtual model."}],"check":"只在低能量虛擬模型中設計狀態圖。","checkEn":"Design state diagrams only in a low-energy virtual model.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「辨識隔離與故障偵測」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains identify isolation and fault detection?","options":["電氣隔離與故障偵測降低異常傳播，但需系統驗證。","不同化學系統在能量、功率、壽命和成本方面取捨不同。","BMS 監測狀態並管理限制，估測荷電狀態帶有誤差。"],"optionsEn":["Electrical isolation and fault detection limit abnormal propagation but need system validation.","Cell chemistries trade energy, power, lifetime and cost differently.","BMS monitors state and manages limits; state-of-charge estimates contain error."],"answer":0,"explanation":"電氣隔離與故障偵測降低異常傳播，但需系統驗證。","explanationEn":"Electrical isolation and fault detection limit abnormal propagation but need system validation."},"prerequisiteIds":["tesla-s02-02"],"sequence":6,"estimatedMinutes":15}]},{"id":"tesla-s03","order":3,"title":"馬達與電力電子","titleEn":"Motor and power electronics","steps":[{"id":"tesla-s03-01","order":1,"title":"理解逆變器角色","titleEn":"Understand inverter functions","objective":"完成「理解逆變器角色」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand inverter functions.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s03-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"逆變器把直流供電轉換為馬達所需的受控電流。","textEn":"An inverter converts DC supply into controlled motor currents."},{"id":"tesla-s03-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"畫出直流端、控制與馬達端。","textEn":"Draw DC input, control and motor output."}],"check":"畫出直流端、控制與馬達端。","checkEn":"Draw DC input, control and motor output.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解逆變器角色」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand inverter functions?","options":["回生受電池接收能力、抓地及系統條件限制。","逆變器把直流供電轉換為馬達所需的受控電流。","機械功率由轉矩與角速度的乘積給出。"],"optionsEn":["Regeneration is limited by battery acceptance, traction and system conditions.","An inverter converts DC supply into controlled motor currents.","Mechanical power is torque multiplied by angular speed."],"answer":1,"explanation":"逆變器把直流供電轉換為馬達所需的受控電流。","explanationEn":"An inverter converts DC supply into controlled motor currents."},"prerequisiteIds":["tesla-s02-03"],"sequence":7,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"tesla-s03-02","order":2,"title":"分析轉矩與轉速","titleEn":"Analyze torque and speed","objective":"完成「分析轉矩與轉速」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for analyze torque and speed.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s03-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"機械功率由轉矩與角速度的乘積給出。","textEn":"Mechanical power is torque multiplied by angular speed."},{"id":"tesla-s03-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"以符號 P = τω 檢查單位。","textEn":"Check units using P = τω."}],"check":"以符號 P = τω 檢查單位。","checkEn":"Check units using P = τω.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「分析轉矩與轉速」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains analyze torque and speed?","options":["機械功率由轉矩與角速度的乘積給出。","回生受電池接收能力、抓地及系統條件限制。","逆變器把直流供電轉換為馬達所需的受控電流。"],"optionsEn":["Mechanical power is torque multiplied by angular speed.","Regeneration is limited by battery acceptance, traction and system conditions.","An inverter converts DC supply into controlled motor currents."],"answer":0,"explanation":"機械功率由轉矩與角速度的乘積給出。","explanationEn":"Mechanical power is torque multiplied by angular speed."},"prerequisiteIds":["tesla-s03-01"],"sequence":8,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"tesla-s03-03","order":3,"title":"理解回生限制","titleEn":"Understand regenerative limits","objective":"完成「理解回生限制」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand regenerative limits.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s03-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"回生受電池接收能力、抓地及系統條件限制。","textEn":"Regeneration is limited by battery acceptance, traction and system conditions."},{"id":"tesla-s03-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"比較三個虛擬工況的能量去向。","textEn":"Compare energy paths in three virtual conditions."}],"check":"比較三個虛擬工況的能量去向。","checkEn":"Compare energy paths in three virtual conditions.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解回生限制」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand regenerative limits?","options":["逆變器把直流供電轉換為馬達所需的受控電流。","機械功率由轉矩與角速度的乘積給出。","回生受電池接收能力、抓地及系統條件限制。"],"optionsEn":["An inverter converts DC supply into controlled motor currents.","Mechanical power is torque multiplied by angular speed.","Regeneration is limited by battery acceptance, traction and system conditions."],"answer":2,"explanation":"回生受電池接收能力、抓地及系統條件限制。","explanationEn":"Regeneration is limited by battery acceptance, traction and system conditions."},"prerequisiteIds":["tesla-s03-02"],"sequence":9,"estimatedMinutes":15}]},{"id":"tesla-s04","order":4,"title":"車體與熱管理","titleEn":"Body and thermal management","steps":[{"id":"tesla-s04-01","order":1,"title":"建立冷卻回路概念","titleEn":"Map cooling loops","objective":"完成「建立冷卻回路概念」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for map cooling loops.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s04-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"電池、馬達與電子件可能有不同溫度需求。","textEn":"Battery, motor and electronics may need different temperature ranges."},{"id":"tesla-s04-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"畫出熱源、換熱器及感測位置。","textEn":"Draw heat sources, exchanger and sensing locations."}],"check":"畫出熱源、換熱器及感測位置。","checkEn":"Draw heat sources, exchanger and sensing locations.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「建立冷卻回路概念」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains map cooling loops?","options":["電池、馬達與電子件可能有不同溫度需求。","整合零件可減少接口，但可能提高維修及製程要求。","接頭、密封與定位需分別量測，外觀完整不足以驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Battery, motor and electronics may need different temperature ranges.","Integration reduces interfaces but may increase repair and process demands.","Joints, seals and alignment need separate measurements beyond appearance."],"answer":0,"explanation":"電池、馬達與電子件可能有不同溫度需求。","explanationEn":"Battery, motor and electronics may need different temperature ranges."},"prerequisiteIds":["tesla-s03-03"],"sequence":10,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"tesla-s04-02","order":2,"title":"理解結構整合取捨","titleEn":"Understand structural integration trade-offs","objective":"完成「理解結構整合取捨」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand structural integration trade-offs.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s04-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"整合零件可減少接口，但可能提高維修及製程要求。","textEn":"Integration reduces interfaces but may increase repair and process demands."},{"id":"tesla-s04-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"比較整合與模組化方案的維修路徑。","textEn":"Compare service paths for integrated and modular designs."}],"check":"比較整合與模組化方案的維修路徑。","checkEn":"Compare service paths for integrated and modular designs.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解結構整合取捨」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand structural integration trade-offs?","options":["接頭、密封與定位需分別量測，外觀完整不足以驗證。","電池、馬達與電子件可能有不同溫度需求。","整合零件可減少接口，但可能提高維修及製程要求。"],"optionsEn":["Joints, seals and alignment need separate measurements beyond appearance.","Battery, motor and electronics may need different temperature ranges.","Integration reduces interfaces but may increase repair and process demands."],"answer":2,"explanation":"整合零件可減少接口，但可能提高維修及製程要求。","explanationEn":"Integration reduces interfaces but may increase repair and process demands."},"prerequisiteIds":["tesla-s04-01"],"sequence":11,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"tesla-s04-03","order":3,"title":"規劃裝配驗證","titleEn":"Plan assembly checks","objective":"完成「規劃裝配驗證」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for plan assembly checks.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s04-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"接頭、密封與定位需分別量測，外觀完整不足以驗證。","textEn":"Joints, seals and alignment need separate measurements beyond appearance."},{"id":"tesla-s04-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"為三類介面建立虛擬檢查欄位。","textEn":"Create virtual inspection fields for three interface classes."}],"check":"為三類介面建立虛擬檢查欄位。","checkEn":"Create virtual inspection fields for three interface classes.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「規劃裝配驗證」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains plan assembly checks?","options":["整合零件可減少接口，但可能提高維修及製程要求。","接頭、密封與定位需分別量測，外觀完整不足以驗證。","電池、馬達與電子件可能有不同溫度需求。"],"optionsEn":["Integration reduces interfaces but may increase repair and process demands.","Joints, seals and alignment need separate measurements beyond appearance.","Battery, motor and electronics may need different temperature ranges."],"answer":1,"explanation":"接頭、密封與定位需分別量測，外觀完整不足以驗證。","explanationEn":"Joints, seals and alignment need separate measurements beyond appearance."},"prerequisiteIds":["tesla-s04-02"],"sequence":12,"estimatedMinutes":15}]},{"id":"tesla-s05","order":5,"title":"軟體與製造資料","titleEn":"Software and manufacturing data","steps":[{"id":"tesla-s05-01","order":1,"title":"管理軟體版本","titleEn":"Manage software versions","objective":"完成「管理軟體版本」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for manage software versions.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s05-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"車輛硬體與軟體版本需相容且可追溯。","textEn":"Hardware and software versions need compatibility and traceability."},{"id":"tesla-s05-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"建立模擬硬體版本與韌體矩陣。","textEn":"Build a simulated hardware-firmware compatibility matrix."}],"check":"建立模擬硬體版本與韌體矩陣。","checkEn":"Build a simulated hardware-firmware compatibility matrix.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「管理軟體版本」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains manage software versions?","options":["更新失敗需保持可恢復狀態，不能假設網路永遠連續。","製造資料缺值、漂移與錯誤標籤可能誤導模型。","車輛硬體與軟體版本需相容且可追溯。"],"optionsEn":["Failed updates need a recoverable state; connectivity cannot be assumed continuous.","Missing data, drift and wrong labels can mislead manufacturing models.","Hardware and software versions need compatibility and traceability."],"answer":2,"explanation":"車輛硬體與軟體版本需相容且可追溯。","explanationEn":"Hardware and software versions need compatibility and traceability."},"prerequisiteIds":["tesla-s04-03"],"sequence":13,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"tesla-s05-02","order":2,"title":"理解更新回復","titleEn":"Understand update recovery","objective":"完成「理解更新回復」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand update recovery.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s05-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"更新失敗需保持可恢復狀態，不能假設網路永遠連續。","textEn":"Failed updates need a recoverable state; connectivity cannot be assumed continuous."},{"id":"tesla-s05-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"為虛擬更新中斷畫出恢復流程。","textEn":"Draw recovery for an interrupted virtual update."}],"check":"為虛擬更新中斷畫出恢復流程。","checkEn":"Draw recovery for an interrupted virtual update.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解更新回復」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand update recovery?","options":["車輛硬體與軟體版本需相容且可追溯。","更新失敗需保持可恢復狀態，不能假設網路永遠連續。","製造資料缺值、漂移與錯誤標籤可能誤導模型。"],"optionsEn":["Hardware and software versions need compatibility and traceability.","Failed updates need a recoverable state; connectivity cannot be assumed continuous.","Missing data, drift and wrong labels can mislead manufacturing models."],"answer":1,"explanation":"更新失敗需保持可恢復狀態，不能假設網路永遠連續。","explanationEn":"Failed updates need a recoverable state; connectivity cannot be assumed continuous."},"prerequisiteIds":["tesla-s05-01"],"sequence":14,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"tesla-s05-03","order":3,"title":"檢查資料品質","titleEn":"Review data quality","objective":"完成「檢查資料品質」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for review data quality.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s05-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"製造資料缺值、漂移與錯誤標籤可能誤導模型。","textEn":"Missing data, drift and wrong labels can mislead manufacturing models."},{"id":"tesla-s05-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"在合成資料中標記三類品質問題。","textEn":"Mark three quality issues in synthetic data."}],"check":"在合成資料中標記三類品質問題。","checkEn":"Mark three quality issues in synthetic data.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「檢查資料品質」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains review data quality?","options":["製造資料缺值、漂移與錯誤標籤可能誤導模型。","車輛硬體與軟體版本需相容且可追溯。","更新失敗需保持可恢復狀態，不能假設網路永遠連續。"],"optionsEn":["Missing data, drift and wrong labels can mislead manufacturing models.","Hardware and software versions need compatibility and traceability.","Failed updates need a recoverable state; connectivity cannot be assumed continuous."],"answer":0,"explanation":"製造資料缺值、漂移與錯誤標籤可能誤導模型。","explanationEn":"Missing data, drift and wrong labels can mislead manufacturing models."},"prerequisiteIds":["tesla-s05-02"],"sequence":15,"estimatedMinutes":15}]},{"id":"tesla-s06","order":6,"title":"安全與交付","titleEn":"Safety and handover","steps":[{"id":"tesla-s06-01","order":1,"title":"辨識高能量邊界","titleEn":"Identify high-energy boundaries","objective":"完成「辨識高能量邊界」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for identify high-energy boundaries.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s06-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"電池與高壓電路存有危險能量，教學應使用虛擬模型。","textEn":"Batteries and high-voltage circuits store hazardous energy, so teaching uses virtual models."},{"id":"tesla-s06-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"確認本課沒有拆解電池或高壓接線操作。","textEn":"Confirm the course contains no battery disassembly or high-voltage wiring."}],"check":"確認本課沒有拆解電池或高壓接線操作。","checkEn":"Confirm the course contains no battery disassembly or high-voltage wiring.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「辨識高能量邊界」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains identify high-energy boundaries?","options":["整車履歷將零件、裝配、軟體及檢驗綁定。","電池與高壓電路存有危險能量，教學應使用虛擬模型。","功能、熱、電氣及软件失效需分開設計驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Vehicle history binds parts, assembly, software and inspection.","Batteries and high-voltage circuits store hazardous energy, so teaching uses virtual models.","Functional, thermal, electrical and software failures need distinct validation."],"answer":1,"explanation":"電池與高壓電路存有危險能量，教學應使用虛擬模型。","explanationEn":"Batteries and high-voltage circuits store hazardous energy, so teaching uses virtual models."},"prerequisiteIds":["tesla-s05-03"],"sequence":16,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"tesla-s06-02","order":2,"title":"建立系統驗證矩陣","titleEn":"Build a system verification matrix","objective":"完成「建立系統驗證矩陣」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for build a system verification matrix.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s06-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"功能、熱、電氣及软件失效需分開設計驗證。","textEn":"Functional, thermal, electrical and software failures need distinct validation."},{"id":"tesla-s06-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"為四類驗證各定義輸入和觀察量。","textEn":"Define inputs and observations for four validation classes."}],"check":"為四類驗證各定義輸入和觀察量。","checkEn":"Define inputs and observations for four validation classes.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「建立系統驗證矩陣」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains build a system verification matrix?","options":["功能、熱、電氣及软件失效需分開設計驗證。","整車履歷將零件、裝配、軟體及檢驗綁定。","電池與高壓電路存有危險能量，教學應使用虛擬模型。"],"optionsEn":["Functional, thermal, electrical and software failures need distinct validation.","Vehicle history binds parts, assembly, software and inspection.","Batteries and high-voltage circuits store hazardous energy, so teaching uses virtual models."],"answer":0,"explanation":"功能、熱、電氣及软件失效需分開設計驗證。","explanationEn":"Functional, thermal, electrical and software failures need distinct validation."},"prerequisiteIds":["tesla-s06-01"],"sequence":17,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"tesla-s06-03","order":3,"title":"交付虛擬製造履歷","titleEn":"Deliver virtual manufacturing history","objective":"完成「交付虛擬製造履歷」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for deliver virtual manufacturing history.","knowledge":[{"id":"tesla-s06-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"整車履歷將零件、裝配、軟體及檢驗綁定。","textEn":"Vehicle history binds parts, assembly, software and inspection."},{"id":"tesla-s06-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"匯出可追溯的示範紀錄。","textEn":"Export traceable demonstration records."}],"check":"匯出可追溯的示範紀錄。","checkEn":"Export traceable demonstration records.","sourceIds":["tesla-manufacturing","tesla-battery"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「交付虛擬製造履歷」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains deliver virtual manufacturing history?","options":["電池與高壓電路存有危險能量，教學應使用虛擬模型。","功能、熱、電氣及软件失效需分開設計驗證。","整車履歷將零件、裝配、軟體及檢驗綁定。"],"optionsEn":["Batteries and high-voltage circuits store hazardous energy, so teaching uses virtual models.","Functional, thermal, electrical and software failures need distinct validation.","Vehicle history binds parts, assembly, software and inspection."],"answer":2,"explanation":"整車履歷將零件、裝配、軟體及檢驗綁定。","explanationEn":"Vehicle history binds parts, assembly, software and inspection."},"prerequisiteIds":["tesla-s06-02"],"sequence":18,"estimatedMinutes":15}]}],"stepCount":18,"estimatedMinutes":270,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"status":"guided","kind":"course"},{"id":"starlink","title":"星鏈與低軌通訊星系","titleEn":"Starlink and Low-Earth-Orbit Networks","category":"space","summary":"以通訊星系的公開架構探索衛星平台、鏈路、地面服務與太空永續。","summaryEn":"Explore public constellation architecture, satellite buses, links, ground services and space sustainability.","scope":"公開原理的分層工程教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務，並非原廠配方、施工圖或操作許可。","scopeEn":"A layered course in public engineering principles. Steps are verifiable learning tasks, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, or operating authorization.","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","sourceIds":["starlink-technology"],"diagram":{"type":"satellite","labels":["衛星平台","電源","天線","光鏈路","地面站"],"labelsEn":["Bus","Power","Antenna","Optical link","Ground station"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"depth":4,"stages":[{"id":"starlink-s01","order":1,"title":"需求與覆蓋","titleEn":"Requirements and coverage","steps":[{"id":"starlink-s01-01","order":1,"title":"建立服務需求","titleEn":"Define service needs","objective":"完成「建立服務需求」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for define service needs.","knowledge":[{"id":"starlink-s01-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"延遲、容量與可用性是不同指標，不能以單一速度代表全部。","textEn":"Latency, capacity and availability differ; one speed figure cannot represent all of them."},{"id":"starlink-s01-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"為教學網路建立三種指標。","textEn":"Define three metrics for the learning network."}],"check":"為教學網路建立三種指標。","checkEn":"Define three metrics for the learning network.","sourceIds":["starlink-technology"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「建立服務需求」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains define service needs?","options":["延遲、容量與可用性是不同指標，不能以單一速度代表全部。","較低軌道可縮短傳播距離，但衛星相對地面持續移動。","星系服務依賴衛星、地面站、使用者終端及網際網路互連。"],"optionsEn":["Latency, capacity and availability differ; one speed figure cannot represent all of them.","Lower orbits shorten propagation paths while satellites move relative to the ground.","Service depends on satellites, gateways, user terminals and internet interconnection."],"answer":0,"explanation":"延遲、容量與可用性是不同指標，不能以單一速度代表全部。","explanationEn":"Latency, capacity and availability differ; one speed figure cannot represent all of them."},"prerequisiteIds":[],"sequence":1,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"starlink-s01-02","order":2,"title":"理解低軌幾何","titleEn":"Understand LEO geometry","objective":"完成「理解低軌幾何」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand leo geometry.","knowledge":[{"id":"starlink-s01-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"較低軌道可縮短傳播距離，但衛星相對地面持續移動。","textEn":"Lower orbits shorten propagation paths while satellites move relative to the ground."},{"id":"starlink-s01-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"用無比例動畫比較移動覆蓋區。","textEn":"Compare moving coverage areas in a not-to-scale animation."}],"check":"用無比例動畫比較移動覆蓋區。","checkEn":"Compare moving coverage areas in a not-to-scale animation.","sourceIds":["starlink-technology"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解低軌幾何」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand leo geometry?","options":["星系服務依賴衛星、地面站、使用者終端及網際網路互連。","延遲、容量與可用性是不同指標，不能以單一速度代表全部。","較低軌道可縮短傳播距離，但衛星相對地面持續移動。"],"optionsEn":["Service depends on satellites, gateways, user terminals and internet interconnection.","Latency, capacity and availability differ; one speed figure cannot represent all of them.","Lower orbits shorten propagation paths while satellites move relative to the ground."],"answer":2,"explanation":"較低軌道可縮短傳播距離，但衛星相對地面持續移動。","explanationEn":"Lower orbits shorten propagation paths while satellites move relative to the ground."},"prerequisiteIds":["starlink-s01-01"],"sequence":2,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"starlink-s01-03","order":3,"title":"區分衛星與地面段","titleEn":"Distinguish space and ground segments","objective":"完成「區分衛星與地面段」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for distinguish space and ground segments.","knowledge":[{"id":"starlink-s01-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"星系服務依賴衛星、地面站、使用者終端及網際網路互連。","textEn":"Service depends on satellites, gateways, user terminals and internet interconnection."},{"id":"starlink-s01-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"追蹤一個封包的概念路徑。","textEn":"Trace one packet's conceptual path."}],"check":"追蹤一個封包的概念路徑。","checkEn":"Trace one packet's conceptual path.","sourceIds":["starlink-technology"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「區分衛星與地面段」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains distinguish space and ground segments?","options":["較低軌道可縮短傳播距離，但衛星相對地面持續移動。","星系服務依賴衛星、地面站、使用者終端及網際網路互連。","延遲、容量與可用性是不同指標，不能以單一速度代表全部。"],"optionsEn":["Lower orbits shorten propagation paths while satellites move relative to the ground.","Service depends on satellites, gateways, user terminals and internet interconnection.","Latency, capacity and availability differ; one speed figure cannot represent all of them."],"answer":1,"explanation":"星系服務依賴衛星、地面站、使用者終端及網際網路互連。","explanationEn":"Service depends on satellites, gateways, user terminals and internet interconnection."},"prerequisiteIds":["starlink-s01-02"],"sequence":3,"estimatedMinutes":15}]},{"id":"starlink-s02","order":2,"title":"衛星平台","titleEn":"Satellite bus","steps":[{"id":"starlink-s02-01","order":1,"title":"建立功率預算","titleEn":"Build a power budget","objective":"完成「建立功率預算」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for build a power budget.","knowledge":[{"id":"starlink-s02-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"太陽能、儲能及負載需在日照與遮蔽情境下平衡。","textEn":"Solar generation, storage and loads balance differently in sunlight and eclipse."},{"id":"starlink-s02-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"建立兩個示意能源情境。","textEn":"Create two illustrative energy scenarios."}],"check":"建立兩個示意能源情境。","checkEn":"Create two illustrative energy scenarios.","sourceIds":["starlink-technology"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「建立功率預算」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains build a power budget?","options":["太空真空中外部對流缺席，輻射與導熱是關鍵熱路徑。","通訊與能源設備需要指向，感測誤差影響控制。","太陽能、儲能及負載需在日照與遮蔽情境下平衡。"],"optionsEn":["In vacuum, external convection is absent; radiation and conduction are key heat paths.","Communication and power equipment need pointing, which sensor error affects.","Solar generation, storage and loads balance differently in sunlight and eclipse."],"answer":2,"explanation":"太陽能、儲能及負載需在日照與遮蔽情境下平衡。","explanationEn":"Solar generation, storage and loads balance differently in sunlight and eclipse."},"prerequisiteIds":["starlink-s01-03"],"sequence":4,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"starlink-s02-02","order":2,"title":"理解熱控方式","titleEn":"Understand thermal control","objective":"完成「理解熱控方式」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand thermal control.","knowledge":[{"id":"starlink-s02-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"太空真空中外部對流缺席，輻射與導熱是關鍵熱路徑。","textEn":"In vacuum, external convection is absent; radiation and conduction are key heat paths."},{"id":"starlink-s02-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"畫出負載到散熱表面的熱路徑。","textEn":"Draw heat paths from load to radiator surface."}],"check":"畫出負載到散熱表面的熱路徑。","checkEn":"Draw heat paths from load to radiator surface.","sourceIds":["starlink-technology"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解熱控方式」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand thermal control?","options":["太陽能、儲能及負載需在日照與遮蔽情境下平衡。","太空真空中外部對流缺席，輻射與導熱是關鍵熱路徑。","通訊與能源設備需要指向，感測誤差影響控制。"],"optionsEn":["Solar generation, storage and loads balance differently in sunlight and eclipse.","In vacuum, external convection is absent; radiation and conduction are key heat paths.","Communication and power equipment need pointing, which sensor error affects."],"answer":1,"explanation":"太空真空中外部對流缺席，輻射與導熱是關鍵熱路徑。","explanationEn":"In vacuum, external convection is absent; radiation and conduction are key heat paths."},"prerequisiteIds":["starlink-s02-01"],"sequence":5,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"starlink-s02-03","order":3,"title":"理解姿態指向","titleEn":"Understand attitude pointing","objective":"完成「理解姿態指向」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand attitude pointing.","knowledge":[{"id":"starlink-s02-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"通訊與能源設備需要指向，感測誤差影響控制。","textEn":"Communication and power equipment need pointing, which sensor error affects."},{"id":"starlink-s02-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"在概念模型標出姿態與指向誤差。","textEn":"Mark attitude and pointing errors in the model."}],"check":"在概念模型標出姿態與指向誤差。","checkEn":"Mark attitude and pointing errors in the model.","sourceIds":["starlink-technology"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解姿態指向」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand attitude pointing?","options":["通訊與能源設備需要指向，感測誤差影響控制。","太陽能、儲能及負載需在日照與遮蔽情境下平衡。","太空真空中外部對流缺席，輻射與導熱是關鍵熱路徑。"],"optionsEn":["Communication and power equipment need pointing, which sensor error affects.","Solar generation, storage and loads balance differently in sunlight and eclipse.","In vacuum, external convection is absent; radiation and conduction are key heat paths."],"answer":0,"explanation":"通訊與能源設備需要指向，感測誤差影響控制。","explanationEn":"Communication and power equipment need pointing, which sensor error affects."},"prerequisiteIds":["starlink-s02-02"],"sequence":6,"estimatedMinutes":15}]},{"id":"starlink-s03","order":3,"title":"通訊鏈路","titleEn":"Communication links","steps":[{"id":"starlink-s03-01","order":1,"title":"理解相控陣概念","titleEn":"Understand phased arrays","objective":"完成「理解相控陣概念」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand phased arrays.","knowledge":[{"id":"starlink-s03-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"控制各單元相位可改變波束方向，陣列幾何影響方向圖。","textEn":"Element phases steer a beam; array geometry shapes its pattern."},{"id":"starlink-s03-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"以相位示意比較兩個波束方向。","textEn":"Compare two beam directions with a phase schematic."}],"check":"以相位示意比較兩個波束方向。","checkEn":"Compare two beam directions with a phase schematic.","sourceIds":["starlink-technology"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解相控陣概念」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand phased arrays?","options":["光鏈路可連接衛星，指向誤差與鏈路可見性影響連通。","控制各單元相位可改變波束方向，陣列幾何影響方向圖。","發射功率、天線增益、路徑損耗與雜訊共同決定鏈路裕量。"],"optionsEn":["Optical links connect satellites, with pointing and visibility affecting connectivity.","Element phases steer a beam; array geometry shapes its pattern.","Power, antenna gain, path loss and noise jointly determine link margin."],"answer":1,"explanation":"控制各單元相位可改變波束方向，陣列幾何影響方向圖。","explanationEn":"Element phases steer a beam; array geometry shapes its pattern."},"prerequisiteIds":["starlink-s02-03"],"sequence":7,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"starlink-s03-02","order":2,"title":"建立鏈路預算","titleEn":"Build a link budget","objective":"完成「建立鏈路預算」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for build a link budget.","knowledge":[{"id":"starlink-s03-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"發射功率、天線增益、路徑損耗與雜訊共同決定鏈路裕量。","textEn":"Power, antenna gain, path loss and noise jointly determine link margin."},{"id":"starlink-s03-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"用假設值計算示意裕量並標明非產品數據。","textEn":"Calculate illustrative margin with clearly labeled assumed values."}],"check":"用假設值計算示意裕量並標明非產品數據。","checkEn":"Calculate illustrative margin with clearly labeled assumed values.","sourceIds":["starlink-technology"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「建立鏈路預算」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains build a link budget?","options":["發射功率、天線增益、路徑損耗與雜訊共同決定鏈路裕量。","光鏈路可連接衛星，指向誤差與鏈路可見性影響連通。","控制各單元相位可改變波束方向，陣列幾何影響方向圖。"],"optionsEn":["Power, antenna gain, path loss and noise jointly determine link margin.","Optical links connect satellites, with pointing and visibility affecting connectivity.","Element phases steer a beam; array geometry shapes its pattern."],"answer":0,"explanation":"發射功率、天線增益、路徑損耗與雜訊共同決定鏈路裕量。","explanationEn":"Power, antenna gain, path loss and noise jointly determine link margin."},"prerequisiteIds":["starlink-s03-01"],"sequence":8,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"starlink-s03-03","order":3,"title":"理解星間光鏈路","titleEn":"Understand optical intersatellite links","objective":"完成「理解星間光鏈路」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand optical intersatellite links.","knowledge":[{"id":"starlink-s03-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"光鏈路可連接衛星，指向誤差與鏈路可見性影響連通。","textEn":"Optical links connect satellites, with pointing and visibility affecting connectivity."},{"id":"starlink-s03-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"在星系圖標出可連接和不可連接的示意邊。","textEn":"Mark possible and unavailable illustrative edges in a constellation graph."}],"check":"在星系圖標出可連接和不可連接的示意邊。","checkEn":"Mark possible and unavailable illustrative edges in a constellation graph.","sourceIds":["starlink-technology"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解星間光鏈路」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand optical intersatellite links?","options":["控制各單元相位可改變波束方向，陣列幾何影響方向圖。","發射功率、天線增益、路徑損耗與雜訊共同決定鏈路裕量。","光鏈路可連接衛星，指向誤差與鏈路可見性影響連通。"],"optionsEn":["Element phases steer a beam; array geometry shapes its pattern.","Power, antenna gain, path loss and noise jointly determine link margin.","Optical links connect satellites, with pointing and visibility affecting connectivity."],"answer":2,"explanation":"光鏈路可連接衛星，指向誤差與鏈路可見性影響連通。","explanationEn":"Optical links connect satellites, with pointing and visibility affecting connectivity."},"prerequisiteIds":["starlink-s03-02"],"sequence":9,"estimatedMinutes":15}]},{"id":"starlink-s04","order":4,"title":"網路與地面段","titleEn":"Network and ground segment","steps":[{"id":"starlink-s04-01","order":1,"title":"模擬衛星切換","titleEn":"Simulate handover","objective":"完成「模擬衛星切換」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for simulate handover.","knowledge":[{"id":"starlink-s04-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"相對運動造成服務衛星改變，切換需保持工作階段連續性。","textEn":"Relative motion changes the serving satellite, requiring session continuity during handover."},{"id":"starlink-s04-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"在虛擬時間軸記錄切換事件。","textEn":"Record handovers on a virtual timeline."}],"check":"在虛擬時間軸記錄切換事件。","checkEn":"Record handovers on a virtual timeline.","sourceIds":["starlink-technology"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「模擬衛星切換」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains simulate handover?","options":["相對運動造成服務衛星改變，切換需保持工作階段連續性。","傳播、排隊及處理延遲需要分開計算。","電源、回程網路與站點條件影響服務韌性。"],"optionsEn":["Relative motion changes the serving satellite, requiring session continuity during handover.","Propagation, queueing and processing delays need separate accounting.","Power, backhaul and site conditions affect service resilience."],"answer":0,"explanation":"相對運動造成服務衛星改變，切換需保持工作階段連續性。","explanationEn":"Relative motion changes the serving satellite, requiring session continuity during handover."},"prerequisiteIds":["starlink-s03-03"],"sequence":10,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"starlink-s04-02","order":2,"title":"比較延遲來源","titleEn":"Compare delay sources","objective":"完成「比較延遲來源」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for compare delay sources.","knowledge":[{"id":"starlink-s04-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"傳播、排隊及處理延遲需要分開計算。","textEn":"Propagation, queueing and processing delays need separate accounting."},{"id":"starlink-s04-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"把一筆示意總延遲分解成三項。","textEn":"Decompose an illustrative total delay into three terms."}],"check":"把一筆示意總延遲分解成三項。","checkEn":"Decompose an illustrative total delay into three terms.","sourceIds":["starlink-technology"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「比較延遲來源」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains compare delay sources?","options":["電源、回程網路與站點條件影響服務韌性。","相對運動造成服務衛星改變，切換需保持工作階段連續性。","傳播、排隊及處理延遲需要分開計算。"],"optionsEn":["Power, backhaul and site conditions affect service resilience.","Relative motion changes the serving satellite, requiring session continuity during handover.","Propagation, queueing and processing delays need separate accounting."],"answer":2,"explanation":"傳播、排隊及處理延遲需要分開計算。","explanationEn":"Propagation, queueing and processing delays need separate accounting."},"prerequisiteIds":["starlink-s04-01"],"sequence":11,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"starlink-s04-03","order":3,"title":"建立地面服務依賴","titleEn":"Map ground-service dependencies","objective":"完成「建立地面服務依賴」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for map ground-service dependencies.","knowledge":[{"id":"starlink-s04-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"電源、回程網路與站點條件影響服務韌性。","textEn":"Power, backhaul and site conditions affect service resilience."},{"id":"starlink-s04-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"模擬一個地面節點離線後的可用路徑。","textEn":"Simulate available paths after one ground node goes offline."}],"check":"模擬一個地面節點離線後的可用路徑。","checkEn":"Simulate available paths after one ground node goes offline.","sourceIds":["starlink-technology"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「建立地面服務依賴」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains map ground-service dependencies?","options":["傳播、排隊及處理延遲需要分開計算。","電源、回程網路與站點條件影響服務韌性。","相對運動造成服務衛星改變，切換需保持工作階段連續性。"],"optionsEn":["Propagation, queueing and processing delays need separate accounting.","Power, backhaul and site conditions affect service resilience.","Relative motion changes the serving satellite, requiring session continuity during handover."],"answer":1,"explanation":"電源、回程網路與站點條件影響服務韌性。","explanationEn":"Power, backhaul and site conditions affect service resilience."},"prerequisiteIds":["starlink-s04-02"],"sequence":12,"estimatedMinutes":15}]},{"id":"starlink-s05","order":5,"title":"製造與環境驗證","titleEn":"Manufacturing and environment testing","steps":[{"id":"starlink-s05-01","order":1,"title":"管理批次構型","titleEn":"Manage batch configurations","objective":"完成「管理批次構型」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for manage batch configurations.","knowledge":[{"id":"starlink-s05-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"大量製造需要追蹤版本差異，不能假設每顆衛星完全相同。","textEn":"Volume production needs revision tracking rather than assuming identical satellites."},{"id":"starlink-s05-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"為虛擬批次建立硬體與軟體版本表。","textEn":"Create hardware and software version tables for virtual batches."}],"check":"為虛擬批次建立硬體與軟體版本表。","checkEn":"Create hardware and software version tables for virtual batches.","sourceIds":["starlink-technology"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「管理批次構型」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains manage batch configurations?","options":["振動及熱真空試驗验證不同環境負載的相容性。","地面測試、模型與在軌資料各有能觀察與不能觀察的範圍。","大量製造需要追蹤版本差異，不能假設每顆衛星完全相同。"],"optionsEn":["Vibration and thermal-vacuum tests verify compatibility with different environments.","Ground tests, models and orbital data have different observation limits.","Volume production needs revision tracking rather than assuming identical satellites."],"answer":2,"explanation":"大量製造需要追蹤版本差異，不能假設每顆衛星完全相同。","explanationEn":"Volume production needs revision tracking rather than assuming identical satellites."},"prerequisiteIds":["starlink-s04-03"],"sequence":13,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"starlink-s05-02","order":2,"title":"理解環境試驗目的","titleEn":"Understand environmental testing","objective":"完成「理解環境試驗目的」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand environmental testing.","knowledge":[{"id":"starlink-s05-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"振動及熱真空試驗验證不同環境負載的相容性。","textEn":"Vibration and thermal-vacuum tests verify compatibility with different environments."},{"id":"starlink-s05-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"把兩種試驗連到可能失效模式。","textEn":"Map both tests to possible failure modes."}],"check":"把兩種試驗連到可能失效模式。","checkEn":"Map both tests to possible failure modes.","sourceIds":["starlink-technology"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解環境試驗目的」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand environmental testing?","options":["大量製造需要追蹤版本差異，不能假設每顆衛星完全相同。","振動及熱真空試驗验證不同環境負載的相容性。","地面測試、模型與在軌資料各有能觀察與不能觀察的範圍。"],"optionsEn":["Volume production needs revision tracking rather than assuming identical satellites.","Vibration and thermal-vacuum tests verify compatibility with different environments.","Ground tests, models and orbital data have different observation limits."],"answer":1,"explanation":"振動及熱真空試驗验證不同環境負載的相容性。","explanationEn":"Vibration and thermal-vacuum tests verify compatibility with different environments."},"prerequisiteIds":["starlink-s05-01"],"sequence":14,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"starlink-s05-03","order":3,"title":"建立測試覆蓋矩陣","titleEn":"Build test coverage","