endencies and trade-offs, not real worldwide service quality.","Relative motion and position uncertainty jointly affect collision risk."],"answer":0,"explanation":"太空系統設計需考慮失效和生命週期結束的處置。","explanationEn":"Space-system design needs failure and end-of-life disposition planning."},"prerequisiteIds":["starlink-s06-01"],"sequence":17,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"starlink-s06-03","order":3,"title":"提交星系教學模型","titleEn":"Submit the constellation learning model","objective":"完成「提交星系教學模型」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for submit the constellation learning model.","knowledge":[{"id":"starlink-s06-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"示意星系可解釋依赖與取捨，不能預測實際全球服務品質。","textEn":"A schematic constellation explains dependencies and trade-offs, not real worldwide service quality."},{"id":"starlink-s06-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"交付覆蓋動畫、鏈路圖與假設清單。","textEn":"Deliver coverage animation, link diagram and assumptions."}],"check":"交付覆蓋動畫、鏈路圖與假設清單。","checkEn":"Deliver coverage animation, link diagram and assumptions.","sourceIds":["starlink-technology"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「提交星系教學模型」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains submit the constellation learning model?","options":["軌道物體相對運動與位置不確定度共同影響風險。","太空系統設計需考慮失效和生命週期結束的處置。","示意星系可解釋依赖與取捨，不能預測實際全球服務品質。"],"optionsEn":["Relative motion and position uncertainty jointly affect collision risk.","Space-system design needs failure and end-of-life disposition planning.","A schematic constellation explains dependencies and trade-offs, not real worldwide service quality."],"answer":2,"explanation":"示意星系可解釋依赖與取捨，不能預測實際全球服務品質。","explanationEn":"A schematic constellation explains dependencies and trade-offs, not real worldwide service quality."},"prerequisiteIds":["starlink-s06-02"],"sequence":18,"estimatedMinutes":15}]}],"stepCount":18,"estimatedMinutes":270,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"status":"guided","kind":"course"},{"id":"three-gorges","title":"長江三峽大壩工程","titleEn":"Three Gorges Dam Engineering","category":"water","summary":"從流域、壩體、水輪機與電網理解大型水利工程，同時把移民、生態與泥砂納入工程需求。","summaryEn":"Study basin, dam, turbine and grid systems while including resettlement, ecology and sediment in engineering requirements.","scope":"公開原理的分層工程教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務，並非原廠配方、施工圖或操作許可。","scopeEn":"A layered course in public engineering principles. Steps are verifiable learning tasks, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, or operating authorization.","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","sourceIds":["ctg-three-gorges","v5-place-c445157198d7","v15s-usbr-manuals","v15s-usbr-instruments"],"diagram":{"type":"dam","labels":["流域","壩體","水輪機","發電機","電網"],"labelsEn":["Basin","Dam","Turbine","Generator","Grid"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"depth":4,"stages":[{"id":"three-gorges-s01","order":1,"title":"流域與公共需求","titleEn":"Basin and public needs","steps":[{"id":"three-gorges-s01-01","order":1,"title":"界定多目標需求","titleEn":"Define multiple objectives","objective":"完成「界定多目標需求」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for define multiple objectives.","knowledge":[{"id":"three-gorges-s01-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"防洪、發電、航運與生態的目標可能衝突。","textEn":"Flood control, generation, navigation and ecology can conflict."},{"id":"three-gorges-s01-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"建立包含受影響社群的需求表。","textEn":"Create requirements including affected communities."}],"check":"建立包含受影響社群的需求表。","checkEn":"Create requirements including affected communities.","sourceIds":["ctg-three-gorges"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「界定多目標需求」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains define multiple objectives?","options":["防洪、發電、航運與生態的目標可能衝突。","平均流量不足以描述洪水、枯水與季節變動。","壩址地質影響滲流、承載與施工條件。"],"optionsEn":["Flood control, generation, navigation and ecology can conflict.","Mean flow cannot describe floods, droughts and seasonal variability.","Dam-site geology affects seepage, support and construction."],"answer":0,"explanation":"防洪、發電、航運與生態的目標可能衝突。","explanationEn":"Flood control, generation, navigation and ecology can conflict."},"prerequisiteIds":[],"sequence":1,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"three-gorges-s01-02","order":2,"title":"閱讀水文資料","titleEn":"Read hydrological data","objective":"完成「閱讀水文資料」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for read hydrological data.","knowledge":[{"id":"three-gorges-s01-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"平均流量不足以描述洪水、枯水與季節變動。","textEn":"Mean flow cannot describe floods, droughts and seasonal variability."},{"id":"three-gorges-s01-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"比較平均值、分布與極端事件。","textEn":"Compare means, distributions and extreme events."}],"check":"比較平均值、分布與極端事件。","checkEn":"Compare means, distributions and extreme events.","sourceIds":["ctg-three-gorges"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「閱讀水文資料」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains read hydrological data?","options":["壩址地質影響滲流、承載與施工條件。","防洪、發電、航運與生態的目標可能衝突。","平均流量不足以描述洪水、枯水與季節變動。"],"optionsEn":["Dam-site geology affects seepage, support and construction.","Flood control, generation, navigation and ecology can conflict.","Mean flow cannot describe floods, droughts and seasonal variability."],"answer":2,"explanation":"平均流量不足以描述洪水、枯水與季節變動。","explanationEn":"Mean flow cannot describe floods, droughts and seasonal variability."},"prerequisiteIds":["three-gorges-s01-01"],"sequence":2,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"three-gorges-s01-03","order":3,"title":"標示地質不確定度","titleEn":"Mark geological uncertainty","objective":"完成「標示地質不確定度」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for mark geological uncertainty.","knowledge":[{"id":"three-gorges-s01-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"壩址地質影響滲流、承載與施工條件。","textEn":"Dam-site geology affects seepage, support and construction."},{"id":"three-gorges-s01-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"在剖面圖區分觀測與推估地層。","textEn":"Distinguish observed and inferred strata in section."}],"check":"在剖面圖區分觀測與推估地層。","checkEn":"Distinguish observed and inferred strata in section.","sourceIds":["ctg-three-gorges"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「標示地質不確定度」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains mark geological uncertainty?","options":["平均流量不足以描述洪水、枯水與季節變動。","壩址地質影響滲流、承載與施工條件。","防洪、發電、航運與生態的目標可能衝突。"],"optionsEn":["Mean flow cannot describe floods, droughts and seasonal variability.","Dam-site geology affects seepage, support and construction.","Flood control, generation, navigation and ecology can conflict."],"answer":1,"explanation":"壩址地質影響滲流、承載與施工條件。","explanationEn":"Dam-site geology affects seepage, support and construction."},"prerequisiteIds":["three-gorges-s01-02"],"sequence":3,"estimatedMinutes":15}]},{"id":"three-gorges-s02","order":2,"title":"壩體與基礎","titleEn":"Dam and foundation","steps":[{"id":"three-gorges-s02-01","order":1,"title":"理解重力壩受力","titleEn":"Understand gravity-dam forces","objective":"完成「理解重力壩受力」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand gravity-dam forces.","knowledge":[{"id":"three-gorges-s02-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"重力壩依靠自重與地基反力抵抗水壓等作用。","textEn":"A gravity dam uses self-weight and foundation reaction against water pressure and other loads."},{"id":"three-gorges-s02-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"以無尺寸圖標示主要力及力矩。","textEn":"Mark principal forces and moments on a dimensionless diagram."}],"check":"以無尺寸圖標示主要力及力矩。","checkEn":"Mark principal forces and moments on a dimensionless diagram.","sourceIds":["ctg-three-gorges"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解重力壩受力」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand gravity-dam forces?","options":["水在基礎和接縫中的壓力會影響有效受力。","水化熱與不均勻冷卻可能造成溫度梯度和裂縫風險。","重力壩依靠自重與地基反力抵抗水壓等作用。"],"optionsEn":["Water pressure in foundations and joints affects effective loading.","Hydration heat and uneven cooling create gradients and cracking risk.","A gravity dam uses self-weight and foundation reaction against water pressure and other loads."],"answer":2,"explanation":"重力壩依靠自重與地基反力抵抗水壓等作用。","explanationEn":"A gravity dam uses self-weight and foundation reaction against water pressure and other loads."},"prerequisiteIds":["three-gorges-s01-03"],"sequence":4,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"three-gorges-s02-02","order":2,"title":"分析揚壓與滲流","titleEn":"Analyze uplift and seepage","objective":"完成「分析揚壓與滲流」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for analyze uplift and seepage.","knowledge":[{"id":"three-gorges-s02-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"水在基礎和接縫中的壓力會影響有效受力。","textEn":"Water pressure in foundations and joints affects effective loading."},{"id":"three-gorges-s02-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"把滲流路徑連到量測與排水功能。","textEn":"Link seepage paths to measurement and drainage functions."}],"check":"把滲流路徑連到量測與排水功能。","checkEn":"Link seepage paths to measurement and drainage functions.","sourceIds":["ctg-three-gorges"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「分析揚壓與滲流」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains analyze uplift and seepage?","options":["重力壩依靠自重與地基反力抵抗水壓等作用。","水在基礎和接縫中的壓力會影響有效受力。","水化熱與不均勻冷卻可能造成溫度梯度和裂縫風險。"],"optionsEn":["A gravity dam uses self-weight and foundation reaction against water pressure and other loads.","Water pressure in foundations and joints affects effective loading.","Hydration heat and uneven cooling create gradients and cracking risk."],"answer":1,"explanation":"水在基礎和接縫中的壓力會影響有效受力。","explanationEn":"Water pressure in foundations and joints affects effective loading."},"prerequisiteIds":["three-gorges-s02-01"],"sequence":5,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"three-gorges-s02-03","order":3,