03-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"畫出三個概念施工階段的功能差異。","textEn":"Compare functions across three conceptual construction phases."}],"check":"畫出三個概念施工階段的功能差異。","checkEn":"Compare functions across three conceptual construction phases.","sourceIds":["ctg-three-gorges"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「建立分期施工地圖」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains map construction phases?","options":["接縫需兼顧變形、滲水及整體承載。","施工期間需要維持必要水流功能並管理臨時結構。","配料、運輸與養護紀錄共同影響混凝土品質追溯。"],"optionsEn":["Joints address deformation, seepage and overall load transfer.","Construction needs water-flow continuity and temporary-structure management.","Batching, transport and curing records support concrete traceability."],"answer":1,"explanation":"施工期間需要維持必要水流功能並管理臨時結構。","explanationEn":"Construction needs water-flow continuity and temporary-structure management."},"prerequisiteIds":["three-gorges-s02-03"],"sequence":7,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"three-gorges-s03-02","order":2,"title":"追蹤材料品質","titleEn":"Track material quality","objective":"完成「追蹤材料品質」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for track material quality.","knowledge":[{"id":"three-gorges-s03-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"配料、運輸與養護紀錄共同影響混凝土品質追溯。","textEn":"Batching, transport and curing records support concrete traceability."},{"id":"three-gorges-s03-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"建立虛擬批次與澆置區塊的關係。","textEn":"Link virtual batches to placement blocks."}],"check":"建立虛擬批次與澆置區塊的關係。","checkEn":"Link virtual batches to placement blocks.","sourceIds":["ctg-three-gorges"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「追蹤材料品質」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains track material quality?","options":["配料、運輸與養護紀錄共同影響混凝土品質追溯。","接縫需兼顧變形、滲水及整體承載。","施工期間需要維持必要水流功能並管理臨時結構。"],"optionsEn":["Batching, transport and curing records support concrete traceability.","Joints address deformation, seepage and overall load transfer.","Construction needs water-flow continuity and temporary-structure management."],"answer":0,"explanation":"配料、運輸與養護紀錄共同影響混凝土品質追溯。","explanationEn":"Batching, transport and curing records support concrete traceability."},"prerequisiteIds":["three-gorges-s03-01"],"sequence":8,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"three-gorges-s03-03","order":3,"title":"理解接縫功能","titleEn":"Understand joint functions","objective":"完成「理解接縫功能」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand joint functions.","knowledge":[{"id":"three-gorges-s03-03-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"接縫需兼顧變形、滲水及整體承載。","textEn":"Joints address deformation, seepage and overall load transfer."},{"id":"three-gorges-s03-03-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"在示意剖面標出接縫需驗證的功能。","textEn":"Mark joint functions requiring verification."}],"check":"在示意剖面標出接縫需驗證的功能。","checkEn":"Mark joint functions requiring verification.","sourceIds":["ctg-three-gorges"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解接縫功能」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains understand joint functions?","options":["施工期間需要維持必要水流功能並管理臨時結構。","配料、運輸與養護紀錄共同影響混凝土品質追溯。","接縫需兼顧變形、滲水及整體承載。"],"optionsEn":["Construction needs water-flow continuity and temporary-structure management.","Batching, transport and curing records support concrete traceability.","Joints address deformation, seepage and overall load transfer."],"answer":2,"explanation":"接縫需兼顧變形、滲水及整體承載。","explanationEn":"Joints address deformation, seepage and overall load transfer."},"prerequisiteIds":["three-gorges-s03-02"],"sequence":9,"estimatedMinutes":15}]},{"id":"three-gorges-s04","order":4,"title":"水輪發電","titleEn":"Hydroelectric generation","steps":[{"id":"three-gorges-s04-01","order":1,"title":"連結水頭與功率","titleEn":"Connect head and power","objective":"完成「連結水頭與功率」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for connect head and power.","knowledge":[{"id":"three-gorges-s04-01-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"概念水力功率為 ρgQH，實際輸出還需乘效率。","textEn":"Conceptual hydraulic power is ρgQH; output also depends on efficiency."},{"id":"three-gorges-s04-01-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"檢查流量、水頭與功率的單位。","textEn":"Check flow, head and power units."}],"check":"檢查流量、水頭與功率的單位。","checkEn":"Check flow, head and power units.","sourceIds":["ctg-three-gorges"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「連結水頭與功率」的核心原理？","questionEn":"Which statement most directly explains connect head and power?","options":["概念水力功率為 ρgQH，實際輸出還需乘效率。","水輪機把水流能量轉為軸功，流況影響效率與振動。","發電機把機械能轉為電能，並網涉及電氣同步及保護。"],"optionsEn":["Conceptual hydraulic power is ρgQH; output also depends on efficiency.","A turbine converts water energy to shaft work; flow conditions affect efficiency and vibration.","A generator converts mechanical to electrical energy; grid connection involves synchronization and protection."],"answer":0,"explanation":"概念水力功率為 ρgQH，實際輸出還需乘效率。","explanationEn":"Conceptual hydraulic power is ρgQH; output also depends on efficiency."},"prerequisiteIds":["three-gorges-s03-03"],"sequence":10,"estimatedMinutes":15},{"id":"three-gorges-s04-02","order":2,"title":"理解水輪機轉換","titleEn":"Understand turbine conversion","objective":"完成「理解水輪機轉換」的概念模型與工程檢核。","objectiveEn":"Build and review the conceptual model for understand turbine conversion.","knowledge":[{"id":"three-gorges-s04-02-k1","title":"核心原理","titleEn":"Core principle","text":"水輪機把水流能量轉為軸功，流況影響效率與振動。","textEn":"A turbine converts water energy to shaft work; flow conditions affect efficiency and vibration."},{"id":"three-gorges-s04-02-k2","title":"總工程師檢核","titleEn":"Chief engineer review","text":"畫出水流、軸功及損失方向。","textEn":"Draw water flow, shaft work and losses."}],"check":"畫出水流、軸功及損失方向。","checkEn":"Draw water flow, shaft work and losses.","sourceIds":["ctg-three-gorges"],"simulationOnly":true,"quiz":{"question":"哪個敘述最直接說明「理解水輪機轉換」的核心原理？","ques