aken byproduct signals.","instruction":"檢查小開口比例對端點訊號的影響。先讀本步來源，標出其實際材料、圖形或工具適用範圍，再以教學草圖或明確假設資料完成任務。建立因果與量測對照表，區分直接觀測、模型推論與尚需額外證據的結論。最後以「開口少可能使反應產物訊號太弱。」檢查推論是否超出證據。","instructionEn":"Assess small open-area effects on endpoint signals. Read the step sources and identify their actual material, pattern or tool scope. Complete the task using an educational sketch or explicitly hypothetical data. Build a cause–measurement table separating direct observations, model inferences and conclusions needing more evidence. Finally check your inference against this principle: Low open area can weaken byproduct signals.","observation":"開口少可能使反應產物訊號太弱。 本步須保留至少一項直接觀測與一項推論的區別。","observationEn":"Low open area can weaken byproduct signals. Preserve the distinction between at least one direct observation and one inference.","failure":"若報告假設「亮度下降一定代表所有區域已蝕刻完成。」，回到本階段原理重畫因果鏈，並補上反例或未量測項。","failureEn":"If the report assumes \"Falling brightness proves every region has finished etching.\", revisit the stage principle, redraw the causal chain and add a counterexample or unmeasured quantity.","check":"交付「檢查小開口比例對端點訊號的影響」的圖表或計算、採用來源、假設與單位；說明本步結論「開口少可能使反應產物訊號太弱。」可由哪些證據支持，並保留一項限制。","checkEn":"Submit the diagram, table or calculation for \"Assess small open-area effects on endpoint signals\", with sources, assumptions and units. Identify evidence supporting \"Low open area can weaken byproduct signals.\" and retain one limitation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a051-v8-16-k1","title":"本步技術判讀","titleEn":"Step-specific technical interpretation","text":"開口少可能使反應產物訊號太弱。","textEn":"Low open area can weaken byproduct signals."},{"id":"a051-v8-16-k2","title":"端點與均勻性的原理與限制","titleEn":"Endpoint and uniformity: principle and limits","text":"電漿端點是間接訊號，需對應實際剩餘膜厚。","textEn":"Plasma endpoint is an indirect signal requiring correlation with remaining thickness."}],"quiz":{"question":"完成「檢查小開口比例對端點訊號的影響」後，哪項判讀可靠？","questionEn":"After \"Assess small open-area effects on endpoint signals\", which interpretation is defensible?"