zation capability"],"answer":3,"explanation":"應確認「孔形及崩角符合金屬化能力」。出口裂紋可降低熱循環耐受，因此僅完成操作或忽略局部異常不能作為通過依據。","explanationEn":"Confirm: Geometry and chipping fit metallization capability. Exit cracks can reduce thermal-cycle endurance, so performing the action or ignoring local anomalies cannot establish a pass."},"sourceIds":["pkb-dupont-substrate","pkb-atotech-glass","pkb-atotech-sap"],"simulationOnly":true,"estimatedMinutes":10,"sequence":343,"order":5,"localOrder":5,"prerequisiteIds":["pk-342"],"prerequisiteMeaning":"learning-sequence","optionalBranch":true,"route":"有機芯或玻璃芯支線；玻璃通孔與有機鑽孔各用其合格路線，不可互換製程參數。","routeEn":"Organic-core or glass-core branch; glass vias and organic drilling use separately qualified routes.","photoId":"bga-inside","photoNote":"本步代表性真實照片（同模組可能共用）。可觀察 BGA 封裝內的晶粒及周邊互連；不將這張傳統封裝內部照片當作扇出、RDL、HBM 或 CPO 實拍。","photoNoteEn":"Representative real photograph for this step (may be shared within the module). Observe a die and surrounding interconnects in a BGA package; this conventional package interior is not a fan-out, RDL, HBM or CPO process photograph.","photoEvidence":"representative-equipment-or-structure"},{"id":"pk-344","stageId":"pk-m14","title":"孔壁去污判讀","titleEn":"Verify hole-wall desmear","objective":"判斷「孔壁去污判讀」是否滿足此具體條件：殘留受控且內層接點未被侵蝕。","objectiveEn":"Determine whether Verify hole-wall desmear meets this specific condition: Residue is controlled without attacking inner contacts.","instruction":"以示意模型練習，並在需要量測時使用你自行提供或從所列來源取得的可用資料：比較孔內殘留與內層銅露出。保存資料來源與樣本識別；依有來源的設計或材料規範判讀。缺少資料或門檻時標記待驗證。","instructionEn":"Practice with the schematic model and, where measurements are needed, use data you supply or obtain from the listed sources: Compare hole residue and exposed inner copper. Preserve provenance and specimen identity, and use documented design or material criteria. Mark the result unverified when data or limits are missing.","observation":"觀察重點：殘留受控且內層接點未被侵蝕；保留局部異常，勿只抄錄平均結果。","observationEn":"Observable evidence: Residue is controlled without attacking inner