行的結果。","checkEn":"Submit acceptance evidence for interpret c4 strain: the specified observation, error sources, supported conclusion and one hold condition.","knowledge":[{"id":"a126-v9-18-k1","title":"判讀 C4 接點應變：機制","titleEn":"Interpret C4 strain: mechanism","text":"中介層柔性與底填會重新分配 C4 應變，不能只看 CTE 差值。","textEn":"Interposer compliance and underfill redistribute C4 strain; CTE difference alone is insufficient.","sourceIds":["pkb-tsmc-cowos","v9at-tsmc-organic","v9at-ti-pdn"]},{"id":"a126-v9-18-k2","title":"判讀 C4 接點應變：證據與判讀","titleEn":"Interpret C4 strain: evidence and interpretation","text":"標出角落接點及約束。 記錄原始觀察和推論之間的區別。","textEn":"Mark corner joints and constraints. Keep raw observations distinct from inference.","sourceIds":["pkb-tsmc-cowos","v9at-tsmc-organic","v9at-ti-pdn"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「判讀 C4 接點應變：反證與驗收」中，哪個處理方式或主張有物理依據？","questionEn":"Which approach or claim is physically justified for interpret c4 strain: challenge and acceptance?","options":["標出角落接點及約束。","有機材料柔軟所以沒有熱應力","RDL 線距夠小就保證高速訊號完整性"],"optionsEn":["Mark corner joints and constraints.","Organic compliance eliminates all thermal stress","Fine RDL spacing guarantees high-speed integrity"],"answer":0,"explanation":"中介層柔性與底填會重新分配 C4 應變，不能只看 CTE 差值。 標出角落接點及約束。","explanationEn":"Interposer compliance and underfill redistribute C4 strain; CTE difference alone is insufficient. Mark corner joints and constraints."}}]},{"id":"a126-v9-stage04","order":4,"title":"整合與驗收","titleEn":"Integration and acceptance","description":"本階段處理整合與驗收：依序完成三個技術單元的模型與獨立驗證，將物理主張連到可觀察資料。","descriptionEn":"Address integration and acceptance through three technical units, each with a model and independent verification linking physical claims to observable evidence.","steps":[{"id":"a126-v9-19","order":1,"sequence":19,"estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["pkb-tsmc-cowos","v9at-tsmc-organic","v9at-ti-pdn"],"prerequisiteIds":["a126-v9-18"],"title":"驗證高速通道","titleEn":"Validate high-speed channels","objective":"建立「驗證高速通道」的可檢驗工程模型，說明：低 RC 不是完整 SI 證明，仍需阻抗、串音及回損。","objectiveEn":"Build a testable engineering model for validate high-speed channels: Low RC does not prove SI; impedance, crosstalk and return loss remain necessary.","instruction":"先在工程筆記畫出本單元的系統邊界、材料或訊號路徑。比較同通道的 DC 與頻域結果。 把操作前後的預測分開記錄，標示量綱、固定條件與一項待量測輸入；引用原始來源的適用條件，不把示意圖當實測。","instructionEn":"Sketch this unit’s system boundary and material or signal path. Compare DC and frequency-domain results for one channel. Record before/after predictions separately, with dimensions, controlled conditions and one input requiring measurement. Respect source validity conditions and distinguish a schematic from measured evidence.","observation":"觀察焦點：比較同通道的 DC 與頻域結果。 只有在控制條件一致且差異大於量測不確定度時，才把差異歸於所討論的機制。","observationEn":"Observation focus: Compare DC and frequency-domain results for one channel. Attribute differences to the mechanism only with matched controls and differences distinguishable from measurement uncertainty.","failure":"需排除的錯判：有機材料柔軟所以沒有熱應力。本步先檢查「驗證高速通道」的證據是否真的支持機制；若不支持，回到低 RC 不是完整 SI 證明，仍需阻抗、串音及回損。所指出的物理限制。","failureEn":"Misinterpretation to reject: Organic compliance eliminates all thermal stress. First check whether evidence for validate high-speed channels actually supports the mechanism. If not, revisit the physical constraint: Low RC does not prove SI; impedance, crosstalk and return loss remain necessary.","check":"交付「驗證高速通道」模型與比較圖，至少包含本步指定的操作、預測方向、量測單位及未驗證假設。","checkEn":"Submit the model and comparison for validate high-speed channels, including the specified action, predicted direction, units and an unvalidated assumption.","knowledge":[{"id":"a126-v9-19-k1","title":"驗證高速通道：機制","titleEn":"Validate high-speed channels: mechanism","text":"低 RC 不是完整 SI 證明，仍需阻抗、串音及回損。","textEn":"Low RC does not prove SI; impedance, crosstalk and return loss remain necessary.","sourceIds":["pkb-tsmc-cowos","v9at-tsmc-organic","v9at-ti-pdn"]},{"id":"a126-v9-19-k2","title":"驗證高速通道：證據與判讀","titleEn":"Validate high-speed channels: evidence and interpretation","text":"比較同通道的 DC 與頻域結果。 記錄原始觀察和推論之間的區別。","textEn":"Compare DC and frequency-domain results for one channel. Keep raw observations distinct from inference.","sourceIds":["pkb-tsmc-cowos","v9at-tsmc-organic","v9at-ti-pdn"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「驗證高速通道」中，哪個處理方式或主張有物理依據？","questionEn":"Which approach or claim is physically justified for validate high-speed channels?","options":["RDL 線距夠小就保證高速訊號完整性","低 RC 不是完整 SI 證明，仍需阻抗、串音及回損。","有機材料柔軟所以沒有熱應力"],"optionsEn":["Fine RDL spacing guarantees high-speed integrity","Low RC does not prove SI; impedance, crosstalk and return loss remain necessary.","Organic compliance eliminates all thermal stress"],"answer":1,"explanation":"低 RC 不是完整 SI 證明，仍需阻抗、串音及回損。 比較同通道的 DC 與頻域結果。","explanationEn":"Low RC does not prove SI; impedance, crosstalk and return loss remain necessary. Compare DC and frequency-domain results for one channel."}},{"id":"a126-v9-20","order":2,"sequence":20,"estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["pkb-tsmc-cowos","v9at-tsmc-organic","v9at-ti-pdn"],"prerequisiteIds":["a126-v9-19"],"title":"驗證高速通道：反證與驗收","titleEn":"Validate high-speed channels: challenge and acceptance","objective":"以獨立證據檢驗「驗證高速通道」的模型，辨別真實效應與量測或模型誤差。","objectiveEn":"Test the validate high-speed channels model with independent evidence and separate physical effects from measurement or model error.","instruction":"沿用上一步模型，但先寫下什麼結果會推翻它。比較同通道的 DC 與頻域結果。 加入一組對照或重複量測，改變一個會造成混淆的條件，將觀察分為支持、矛盾及仍不足。若只有模擬資料，清楚標成模擬，並指定下一項實物驗證。","instructionEn":"Use the previous model, first specifying what result would refute it. Compare DC and frequency-domain results for one channel. Add a control or repeated measurement, vary one confounder, and classify observations as supporting, conflicting or insufficient. Label simulated data explicitly and specify the next physical validation.","observation":"觀察焦點：比較同通道的 DC 與頻域結果。 只有在控制條件一致且差異大於量測不確定度時，才把差異歸於所討論的機制。","observationEn":"Observation focus: Compare DC and frequency-domain results for one channel. Attribute differences to the mechanism only with matched controls and differences distinguishable from measurement uncertainty.","failure":"需排除的錯判：RDL 線距夠小就保證高速訊號完整性。本步先檢查「驗證高速通道」的證據是否真的支持機制；若不支持，回到低 RC 不是完整 SI 證明，仍需阻抗、串音及回損。所指出的物理限制。","failureEn":"Misinterpretation to reject: Fine RDL spacing guarantees high-speed integrity. First check whether evidence for validate high-speed channels actually supports the mechanism. If not, revisit the physical constraint: Low RC does not prove SI; impedance, crosstalk and return loss remain necessary.","check":"交付「驗證高速通道」的驗收紀錄：包含指定觀察、誤差來源、能支持的結論與一項應暫緩放行的結果。","checkEn":"Submit acceptance evidence for validate high-speed channels: the specified observation, error sources, supported conclusion and one hold condition.","knowledge":[{"id":"a126-v9-20-k1","title":"驗證高速通道：機制","titleEn":"Validate high-speed channels: mechanism","text":"低 RC 不是完整 SI 證明，仍需阻抗、串音及回損。","textEn":"Low RC does not prove SI; impedance, crosstalk and return loss remain necessary.","sourceIds":["pkb-tsmc-cowos","v9at-tsmc-organic","v9at-ti-pdn"]},{"id":"a126-v9-20-k2","title":"驗證高速通道：證據與判讀","titleEn":"Validate high-speed channels: evidence and interpretation","text":"比較同通道的 DC 與頻域結果。 記錄原始觀察和推論之間的區別。","textEn":"Compare DC and frequency-domain results for one channel. Keep raw observations distinct from inference.","sourceIds":["pkb-tsmc-cowos","v9at-tsmc-organic","v9at-ti-pdn"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「驗證高速通道：反證與驗收」中，哪個處理方式或主張有物理依據？","questionEn":"Which approach or claim is physically justified for validate high-speed channels: challenge and acceptance?","options":["有機材料柔軟所以沒有熱應力","RDL 線距夠小就保證高速訊號完整性","比較同通道的 DC 與頻域結果。"],"optionsEn":["Organic compliance eliminates all thermal stress","Fine RDL spacing guarantees high-speed integrity","Compare DC and frequency-domain results for one channel."],"answer":2,"explanation":"低 RC 不是完整 SI 證明，仍需阻抗、串音及回損。 比較同通道的 DC 與頻域結果。","explanationEn":"Low RC does not prove SI; impedance, crosstalk and return loss remain necessary. Compare DC and frequency-domain results for one channel."}},{"id":"a126-v9-21","order":3,"sequence":21,"estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["pkb-tsmc-cowos","v9at-tsmc-organic","v9at-ti-pdn"],"prerequisiteIds":["a126-v9-20"],"title":"交叉可靠度證據","titleEn":"Cross-check reliability evidence","objective":"建立「交叉可靠度證據」的可檢驗工程模型，說明：電性菊鏈、熱循環及界面影像提供互補資訊。","objectiveEn":"Build a testable engineering model for cross-check reliability evidence: Daisy chains, thermal cycling and interface images provide complementary evidence.","instruction":"先在工程筆記畫出本單元的系統邊界、材料或訊號路徑。配準失效位置與局部翹曲。 把操作前後的預測分開記錄，標示量綱、固定條件與一項待量測輸入；引用原始來源的適用條件，不把示意圖當實測。","instructionEn":"Sketch this unit’s system boundary and material or signal path. Register failure locations with local warpage. Record before/after predictions separately, with dimensions, controlled conditions and one input requiring measurement. Respect source validity conditions and distinguish a schematic from measured evidence.","observation":"觀察焦點：配準失效位置與局部翹曲。 只有在控制條件一致且差異大於量測不確定度時，才把差異歸於所討論的機制。","observationEn":"Observation focus: Register failure locations with local warpage. Attribute differences to the mechanism only with matched controls and differences distinguishable from measurement uncertainty.","failure":"需排除的錯判：有機材料柔軟所以沒有熱應力。本步先檢查「交叉可靠度證據」的證據是否真的支持機制；若不支持，回到電性菊鏈、熱循環及界面影像提供互補資訊。所指出的物理限制。","failureEn":"Misinterpretation to reject: Organic compliance eliminates all thermal stress. First check whether evidence for cross-check reliability evidence actually supports the mechanism. If not, revisit the physical constraint: Daisy chains, thermal cycling and interface images provide complementary evidence.","check":"交付「交叉可靠度證據」模型與比較圖，至少包含本步指定的操作、預測方向、量測單位及未驗證假設。","checkEn":"Submit the model and comparison for cross-check reliability evidence, including the specified action, predicted direction, units and an unvalidated assumption.","knowledge":[{"id":"a126-v9-21-k1","title":"交叉可靠度證據：機制","titleEn":"Cross-check reliability evidence: mechanism","text":"電性菊鏈、熱循環及界面影像提供互補資訊。","textEn":"Daisy chains, thermal cycling and interface images provide complementary evidence.","sourceIds":["pkb-tsmc-cowos","v9at-tsmc-organic","v9at-ti-pdn"]},{"id":"a126-v9-21-k2","title":"交叉可靠度證據：證據與判讀","titleEn":"Cross-check reliability evidence: evidence and interpretation","text":"配準失效位置與局部翹曲。 記錄原始觀察和推論之間的區別。","textEn":"Register failure locations with local warpage. Keep raw observations distinct from inference.","sourceIds":["pkb-tsmc-cowos","v9at-tsmc-organic","v9at-ti-pdn"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「交叉可靠度證據」中，哪個處理方式或主張有物理依據？","questionEn":"Which approach or claim is physically justified for cross-check reliability evidence?","options":["電性菊鏈、熱循環及界面影像提供互補資訊。","有機材料柔軟所以沒有熱應力","RDL 線距夠小就保證高速訊號完整性"],"optionsEn":["Daisy chains, thermal cycling and interface images provide complementary evidence.","Organic compliance eliminates all thermal stress","Fine RDL spacing guarantees high-speed integrity"],"answer":0,"explanation":"電性菊鏈、熱循環及界面影像提供互補資訊。 配準失效位置與局部翹曲。","explanationEn":"Daisy chains, thermal cycling and interface images provide complementary evidence. Register failure locations with local warpage."}},{"id":"a126-v9-22","order":4,"sequence":22,"estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["pkb-tsmc-cowos","v9at-tsmc-organic","v9at-ti-pdn"],"prerequisiteIds":["a126-v9-21"],"title":"交叉可靠度證據：反證與驗收","titleEn":"Cross-check reliability evidence: challenge and acceptance","objective":"以獨立證據檢驗「交叉可靠度證據」的模型，辨別真實效應與量測或模型誤差。","objectiveEn":"Test the cross-check reliability evidence model with independent evidence and separate physical effects from measurement or model error.","instruction":"沿用上一步模型，但先寫下什麼結果會推翻它。配準失效位置與局部翹曲。 加入一組對照或重複量測，改變一個會造成混淆的條件，將觀察分為支持、矛盾及仍不足。若只有模擬資料，清楚標成模擬，並指定下一項實物驗證。","instructionEn":"Use the previous model, first specifying what result would refute it. Register failure locations with local warpage. Add a control or repeated measurement, vary one confounder, and classify observations as supporting,